# 🧠 Remember `this` vs `super`

This is the easiest way I want you to remember it:

```text
this  → ME 👤
super → MY PARENT 👨
```

That's it.

### `this`

```java
this.name
```

means:

> **My object's name.**

### `super`

```java
super.name
```

means:

> **My parent's name.**

